config KEYBOARD_XIAOMI_NANOSIC803
	tristate "Xiaomi Nanosic 803 pogo keyboard and touchpad"
	depends on I2C && OF && INPUT_KEYBOARD
	help
	  Support the Nanosic 803 controller in the POCO Pad X1 focus
	  keyboard. Reports the key matrix, the touchpad and the keyboard
	  backlight through Linux input and LED class.

	  MiAuth is not implemented. The controller may stop reporting after
	  an idle timeout until it is reset.
